# Build context for apps/assess/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore beside the Dockerfile). The image is built from
# source inside Linux: nothing installed or built on the host, and nothing private (data, ledgers, env files) may enter the context.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/out
**/data
**/data-e2e
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.bak
**/.env*
**/*.log
backups
restored
vendor
.vendor
.claude
.crossline-evidence
e2e
docs
playwright-report
test-results
coverage
